# Paladin 2: gptokeyb owns the pad and emits a real uinput keyboard.
# ROCKNIX retrogame_joypad db is Nintendo-labelled: a:b1 (east / physical A),
# b:b0 (south / physical B). gptokeyb "a" is therefore the face button named A.
# Pal2 binds Return to OK+Menu; that Menu bit toggles 系统/设置, so A-as-Enter
# opens a menu then backs out of it. Space is OK only.
# SELECT+START still kills machismo via gptokeyb -k.
back = esc
start = space
a = space
b = esc
x = x
y = y
l1 = q
r1 = e
up = up
down = down
left = left
right = right
left_analog_up = up
left_analog_down = down
left_analog_left = left
left_analog_right = right
right_analog_up = up
right_analog_down = down
right_analog_left = left
right_analog_right = right
